# clasp (contains the Apps Script ID)
# These are literal paths, not a pattern — a new GAS project needs its own line here
# BEFORE the directory is created, or its script ID gets committed on the first add.
#
# The first line outlives the V1 source deleted on 2026-08-15, on purpose: developer
# machines that worked on V1 still hold that file, it still carries the live Script ID
# of the external Apps Script project, and dropping the line would surface it as an
# untracked file waiting to be committed by accident.
scripts/gas/.clasp.json
scripts/gas-v2/.clasp.json

# hosting-automation credentials (cPanel + Namecheap) — never commit
scripts/hosting/.env
